	"Information"
	{
		"Version"
		{
			"Latest"		"3.0.0"
			"Previously"	"2.1.4"
		}
		
		"Notes"	"Emblems: 89 emblems with their own powers and effects, enabled with E and used with the gravity gun."
		"Notes"	"Power Booth upgrades, big emblems, emblem drops, reward pickups and the free emblem on build load."
		"Notes"	"Hats, celweps (separate weapons with the Custom Guns plugin) and buyable or admin player models."
		"Notes"	"Working !buy and !sell, plus !give, !trade, !cl, the Guess Booth and auctions."
		"Notes"	"Builds load into your land and keep teleports, welds, buttons, message and sound cels."
		"Notes"	"Event and restricted areas, !thirdperson and many commands from the original server."
		"Notes"	"v3.0.0 is now released!"
	}
	
